OL,3,GNEWSADundee University confirms
OL,4,Areduction in proposed job losses
OL,5,
OL,6,FDundee University said it plans to cut
OL,7,F154 jobs as it deals with a
OL,8,Fseven-figure deficit, 33 fewer roles
OL,9,Fthan previously proposed.
OL,11,FThe university's original proposal in
OL,12,FJune was to cut 187 jobs, but this
OL,13,Ffigure has been reduced following a
OL,14,F10-week consultation process.
OL,16,FIndividual staff will be told later
OL,17,Fwhether their roles are still at risk
OL,18,Ffollowing the consultation.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
