OL,3,GNEWSADundee University confirms
OL,4,Areduction in proposed job losses
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe university has already cut about
OL,7,F675 jobs through voluntary
OL,8,Fredundancies, but said it still needed
OL,9,Fto make annual savings of about #20m -
OL,10,Fmostly from staff costs.
